<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .header { background-color: #d32f2f; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; background-color: #f5f5f5; }
        .error-details { background-color: white; padding: 15px; margin: 15px 0; border-left: 4px solid #d32f2f; }
        .severity-critical { border-left-color: #d32f2f; }
        .severity-high { border-left-color: #ff6f00; }
        .severity-medium { border-left-color: #fbc02d; }
        .severity-low { border-left-color: #388e3c; }
        .label { font-weight: bold; color: #666; }
        .value { margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .button { 
            display: inline-block; 
            padding: 10px 20px; 
            background-color: #1976d2; 
            color: white; 
            text-decoration: none; 
            border-radius: 4px; 
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        .footer { padding: 15px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #666; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>⚠️ Flow Error Alert</h1>
        <h2>{!Flow_Error__c.Flow_Name__c}</h2>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
        <div class="error-details severity-{!LOWER(Flow_Error__c.Severity__c)}">
            <h3>Error Details</h3>
            
            <div class="value">
                <span class="label">Severity:</span> 
                <strong>{!Flow_Error__c.Severity__c}</strong>
            </div>
            
            <div class="value">
                <span class="label">Error Type:</span> 
                {!Flow_Error__c.Error_Type__c}
            </div>
            
            <div class="value">
                <span class="label">Timestamp:</span> 
                {!Flow_Error__c.Error_Timestamp__c}
            </div>
            
            <div class="value">
                <span class="label">User:</span> 
                {!Flow_Error__c.User__c}
            </div>
            
            <div class="value">
                <span class="label">Record ID:</span> 
                {!Flow_Error__c.Record_Id__c}
            </div>
            
            <div class="value">
                <span class="label">Error Message:</span>
                <pre style="background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 10px; border-radius: 4px; overflow-x: auto;">{!Flow_Error__c.Error_Message__c}</pre>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <h3>Immediate Actions Required</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Review the error log record in Salesforce</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Check the affected record</strong> (Record ID above)</li>
            <li><strong>Verify succession management contact cadence is functioning</strong></li>
            <li><strong>If critical: Manually create successor contact tasks as needed</strong></li>
            <li><strong>Mark error as Resolved after taking corrective action</strong></li>
        </ul>
        
        <a href="{!Flow_Error__c.Link}" class="button">View Error Record</a>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
        <p>This is an automated notification from the Succession Management Error Handling Framework.</p>
        <p>Do not reply to this email. For support, contact your Salesforce administrator.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
